# Connecting two machines directly together 
## Test 14: extract_cwnd/outputs/3 GB/40004
- sudo tc qdisc add dev eno1 root tbf rate 1Gbit burst 1mb limit 50000
- 1Gbit is equivalent to 125mb
- **rtt is 0.200ms**. Thus...
  BDD = 0.0002s * 125mb = 0.025mb = 25kb = 25000 bytes
  The queue size is then set to "double of this" thus 50000 bytes 
- Now two machines are connected together so rtt wouldn't be a problem


